{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111561","id":2908099324,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6tVhL8","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111561","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111561.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111561.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111561","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111561/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111561/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111561/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c17e76572dc9a9317f5a147a88ec56475730396e","number":111561,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Core: Fix missing includes in `type_info.h`","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Added includes for `variant.h` and `object.h` to `type_info.h`. \r\n\r\nThese were missing but due to `type_info.h` always being included after `class_db.h` wherever it was included, the `Variant` and `Object` classes would be defined and would let it compile. \r\nThis made removing `class_db.h` in many places impossible as it would break `type_info.h`.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary> Old version of the PR </summary>\r\nReworks the include chains in core/variant. \r\n\r\n* Part of #111218 \r\n\r\nChanges:\r\n* Added includes for `variant.h` and `object.h` to `type_info.h`. These were missing but due to `type_info.h` always being included after `class_db.h` wherever it was included, the `Variant` and `Object` classes would be defined and would let it compile. This made removing `class_db.h` in many places impossible as it would break `type_info.h`\r\n  * This will likely come at a performance cost, since the total # of includes by `type_info.h` goes from 4 to 70\r\n  * See [rocket chat discussion](https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/core/thread/2oLCSgT6dqwKNEzxi)\r\n* Following up on that, `class_db.h` was removed from `variant_construct.h`, `variant_destruct.h`, `variant_op.h`, `variant_setget.h`, and `dictionary.h`.\r\n  * This results in the `core/variant` being theoretically completely decoupled from `class_db.h`\r\n* Migrated some includes from `*.h` to `*.cpp` as they are only needed there in those cases.\r\n* `variant_construct.h` was very bloated in terms of includes, this has been fixed\r\n* Various removals and purely-transitive-to-direct replacements. Also added some explicit includes in some places which accessed it only transitively. \r\n\r\nMy machine is too slow and unpredictable to measure compile-time difference between this and master, so I can't provide those stats. \r\n</details>","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id